  "description": "Data center electricity load by state, 2023 (EPRI Table A1). Used as a proxy for where data center cooling (and therefore refrigerant monitoring demand) is concentrated. It is not a count of facilities, not a market size and not a ThermGAS sales estimate. States not in the table are shown as Not Verified / Insufficient Evidence.",
